{"version":1,"content":"<p>姜濤早前曾透露家中迎來新成員愛犬「小白」，引起不少粉絲關注與好奇。</p><p>今日（28日）凌晨，姜濤於社交平台發文，首度分享親手繪畫的「小白」畫像，並感性透露暫不打算公開愛犬的正面照片與真實名字，希望保護牠在無焦距的自由環境下健康成長。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:58:26.084532+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:32:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:11.769354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:58:26.084532+00:00","content_hash":"aec5328e17dc5b40912dcd4c46eb52142e100f6d5d05e13c83930e09ea82197e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}